{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "996728fbd65a434869f2e4861f31f4397369c0ce454f859eb99638d437f745ce", "ja": "はあ……。\nやらかしてしまったなぁ……。", "zh": "唉……  \n搞砸了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "dc2fb4c5445ff1bdf2af7864f713b7dca7f93042273c088b2bce195de90acbd7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n元気がありませんけど……どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n看起来没什么精神……是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a0bd0a7578e71ec94bc76651857322e9f1d3a25b84947a108f767228f83e87ea", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。実は今日、\n打ち合わせに遅れてしまったんです……。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。其实今天，我开会迟到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "eb439c7cebd5e4e0b26fbd30bfad7d2ba7584722e5a35b0cf91d63e26c106059", "ja": "スマホのアラームが鳴らなかったり、電車も遅延が\n連続したり……そういうのが続いてしまって。", "zh": "手机闹钟没响，电车也接连晚点……这样的事情接二连三地发生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "34daea84dcba394e627f37c865905b79338b91e4fe985f2afa688099a78ff45d", "ja": "それで落ち込んでいたんですね……。\nでも、{$P$}さんはえらいです！", "zh": "原来是因为那些事而情绪低落啊……不过，{$P$}先生很了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "b492495384f2db0c4768aa017e3f286ce230a7c5ef148ddc9d57be261bc55b90", "ja": "落ち込むのは、劇場のためアイドルのため、\n毎日頑張っている証拠ですから！", "zh": "因为能感到沮丧，正是每天为剧场、为偶像努力拼搏的证明嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "24d6c35e0a3e808e190e9e2bce71c662f0872af98b70f3f3e799e6ff35b5499e", "ja": "それは……まあ、毎日頑張るのは当然かなと……。\n仕事ですし……。", "zh": "那是……不过，每天努力也是理所当然的吧……。\n毕竟是工作……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "fb51792eeb20fde8bdeb0851044760d46542ab1772cb949dc67ca62860d0bba5", "ja": "その当然に、みんな助けられているんですよ。\nもちろん私もです。", "zh": "正是因为有这份理所当然，大家才能得到帮助。\n当然也包括我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "d0689a3c10ecd09ebf47fd4d2c77d45422d3e1b7f6e18852a61ab03a9860c1b7", "ja": "だから、{$P$}さん。\n今日もお仕事頑張っていて、とってもえらいです♪", "zh": "所以，{$P$}先生。\n今天也努力工作，真的很了不起♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c87959235cd8466b00a55442d89cf7c34f87dbe307afa5d08bd54542b1c57a6f", "ja": "なんだかむずがゆいような……でも、元気が\n出てきました。ありがとうございます、青羽さん！", "zh": "总觉得有点不好意思……不过，我已经打起精神来了。谢谢你，青羽小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "8a381b71ab9b94b5972001cd30cd574acfc6af0770b6601f40517a8711011981", "ja": "えへへ……あっ、そうだ！　社長さんがお待ちですよ。\n{$P$}さんにお話があるみたいです。", "zh": "嘿嘿……啊，对了！社长正在等您呢。\n好像有话要和{$P$}先生说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e1a1e34fee619fa4135740c1ed2e2469652e83bdee173e11c9264754809d8f03", "ja": "そうでしたか。\nそれじゃ、事務所に行ってきますね！", "zh": "原来如此。\n那我先去事务所啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "d29a774df4019e001c7d6e4c27bc775335fafe2d3cc1823866a8b37aa5b9b52e", "ja": "いってらっしゃ～い！　……この調子で、\nお姉ちゃんもたくさん励ましてあげようっと♪", "zh": "路上小心～！……就照这个势头，\n我也要多多鼓励姐姐才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "96afb85da40ea2548a4ca53c9694b9b4dc9af2ed14e3345e452f346440d5bd7a", "ja": "失礼します。\n社長、お呼びでしょうか？", "zh": "打扰了。\n社长，您找我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "40accfdb5756293920b3a8787623544f7de7c04230534f7eb53d6603006c497a", "ja": "ああ、君か……。\n首を長くして、待っていたよ……。", "zh": "啊，是你啊……\n我可是望眼欲穿地等着你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d43670c5d9c06d1231d5e7891738b9440da260bc1d1ce78b798ea7e86f1fb403", "ja": "そ、そこまでお待たせしたつもりはないんですが……\nすみません、遅かったでしょうか？", "zh": "没、没觉得让您等了那么久啊……\n对不起，是我来晚了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "060d31701ad9da0a2765fedc4c83365bcfbcac08797b394b36ea7ee66e6a83c1", "ja": "違うんです。{$P$}さんが\n悪いわけではないんです。", "zh": "不是这样的。并不是{$P$}先生的错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "78326158f37d8fd4711a12bea45789fbfd878ed148cae7f219014d6a5f963c87", "ja": "実は、朝のTV番組の占い、社長の星座が最下位で……\nそのことを、ずっと気にしているみたいなんです。", "zh": "其实，是因为早上电视节目的星座占卜，社长的星座排在最后一名……\n他好像就一直很在意这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "01f22fd20da63c87a0c91ad572375602ea401f2234ccf6256d1ad5f0bfb2a06a", "ja": "なるほど、それで落ち込んで……。\nでもこの覇気のなさは……ちょっと困りましたね。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才会这么消沉……不过这副无精打采的样子……确实有点伤脑筋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "d513f112caf300fbcb83217ee2a0762ec75041ab0425f5dc3b7f5112dabe477b", "ja": "そろそろ仕事に支障が出てしまいますからね……。\nここは奥の手を使いましょう。", "zh": "差不多要影响工作了……。\n看来得使出最后的手段了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "edd7b6c80a249363366b32e867157e1f7d9ad15527ad8a493696d16c0fd5901e", "ja": "社長、元気を出してください！\n今日の社長、とってもステキですよ♪", "zh": "社长，打起精神来吧！\n今天的社长，真的好帅气哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "572d03c64391dfad6a34611c51ecd4908687ee3637cd60ac5d8adb9437e7e1ce", "ja": "え……私がステキ……？\n音無君、本当かい？", "zh": "诶……我很棒……？\n音无，真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "cc6aa6726c1bc069c54636298d3cdef2b75e8617bd7e394d2505171009827aaa", "ja": "ええ。髪型も決まってますし、色も黒々としていて、\nまさに社長って感じです！　よっ、ナイスミドル！", "zh": "没错。您的发型也很精神，头发颜色乌黑发亮，简直就是社长的感觉！哟，不愧是魅力大叔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "9f2bc4535e7d27e91c8612cc30e9a1bb14e4c79b673bf4f7291f22414a6de8ca", "ja": "そ、そうかね？　いやあ、実は最近ヘアトニックを\n変えて……効果が出てきたようだ。はっはっは！", "zh": "是、是这样吗？哎呀，其实我最近换了护发液……好像开始见效了。哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "8722fa880eb22c6a1bfc0bf3b5aad414eaf98d72f631016ada4e4a38f4a1dc72", "ja": "いやはや、音無君のサポートに助けられてしまったね。\n情けないところを見せてしまったかな？", "zh": "哎呀呀，真是多亏了音无的支持啊。是不是让你看到了我丢脸的一面？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "205cfe43b463edd045f08a314001ff798a5eeb0f0ca96c8ed4b2849e345978e2", "ja": "いえ、気持ちはわかります。ちょっとした事で、\nメンタルは意外と削られるものですから。", "zh": "不会，我很能理解您的心情。因为哪怕只是一点小事，\n心态也意外地容易受到打击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "9d166684db71db96cd75278a4756771d7a5be3eae2616adb4652d1075ba13865", "ja": "うむ。そして、励まされたり褒められたりするだけで、\nぐんぐん元気が出るのだから不思議なものだ……。", "zh": "嗯。而且只要受到鼓励或夸奖，就会变得越来越有精神，真是不可思议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "eb31b95e267dccefa52dd86fdc2ab1d73d813f9547763b11182d4e81c1703405", "ja": "そういう意味でも、次の『LOVERS HEART』公演\nの新曲は、うってつけじゃないかと思う！", "zh": "从这个意义上说，我觉得接下来的『LOVERS HEART』公演的新歌也再合适不过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "37e1d8044c501700c7631194390b96cc72eb02fc2e27bf97d912ea5780c5ceb4", "ja": "あっ、お願いしていた新曲ですね！？\nもしかして、もうできたんですか？", "zh": "啊，是之前拜托的新歌吧！？\n难道已经完成了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "17560f98e937753d2b41bd8785b398274a9ca53f3ea916e033a9291c64a725b5", "ja": "うむ！　さっき届いたばかりだ。\n一緒に聞こうと思ってね！", "zh": "嗯！刚刚才送到呢。\n我想着和你一起听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3b4e627406541a9e13301badf240e38dc284097f968ee99ebcd16d732b1e000b", "ja": "これは……聞いているだけで、元気が出てきます！\nチアソングにして、正解でした！", "zh": "这个……光是听着就让人精神起来了！\n选作啦啦队歌曲，果然没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "23661b1b69fe7364ca26736ad5ff4113d22ba355a539c699335c603ab280048a", "ja": "いろいろ、アイディアが浮かんできたので……\n早速、公演の準備に取りかかろうと思います！", "zh": "因为想到了各种各样的点子……\n我想马上开始准备公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "76fe341846bc5a82ee10740e9312be9a47f592dede6e149dfd827e8960ea31a3", "ja": "そのやる気、さすがだ！　人を励ます応援という行為、\nアイドルとの親和性はバッチリなはず……。", "zh": "这份干劲真不愧是你！给人打气的支持行为，应该和偶像非常契合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1035_president", "source_sha256": "8bb40d510cea99d2078f34b2f697704ef0213b51bedcae6d066261aefb77ac64", "ja": "いろいろな人……いや、この世界そのものを\n応援するような、素晴らしい公演を期待しているよ！", "zh": "我期待着一场能为形形色色的人……不，是为这个世界本身加油的精彩演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0233_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_intro_1036_p", "source_sha256": "1343769ed3469555d7d08db49f67bf05190ba133dde4cd081f006c40c06edd0f", "ja": "はい、頑張ります！　さっきの音無さんの励ましも、\n公演の参考にさせてもらおうと思います！", "zh": "好的，我会努力的！刚才音无小姐的鼓励，我也会将其作为公演的参考！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
